Package: oobinary
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign Bit Packer and Stream Aligner
 Bit-level endianness converter, bitmask applicator, and stream aligner.
 100% pure native openOODA (.oo) utility with zero ambient authority,
 dual POSIX CLI and streaming JSON-RPC 2.0 Model Context Protocol (MCP) server.
